# Checklist 41 (the emulator half): plan the night's satellites, start the
# plan, and stop it. The passes themselves are hours apart, so this checks
# the plan is made and the runner starts and stops cleanly.
name    Night plan: plan, run, stop
timeout 200

expect 30  [SCENARIO] Night plan
wait   5
press  GOTO:PASSES
wait   5
press  GOTO:PLAN THE NIGHT
expect 30  Satellite plan:
press  GOTO:RUN THE PLAN
expect 10  Satellite plan running:
wait   8
shot   plan-running
press  GOTO:RUN THE PLAN
expect 20  stopped by the operator
absent 10  slewing to where the window opens.
